A</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Beef Extract, Paste<br>Beef Extract, Powder<br><b>Bacto™</b> Beef Extract, Desiccated<br>Beef Heart for Infusion<br><b>Bacto™</b> Brain Heart Infusion<br><b>Bacto™</b> Brain Heart Infusion, Porcine<br><b>Bacto™</b> Neopeptone Peptone<br><b>Bacto™</b> Peptone<br><b>Gelysate™</b> Peptone</td>\n<td><b>Polypeptone™</b> Peptone<br><b>Bacto™</b> Proteose Peptone<br><b>BiTek</b> Proteose Peptone<br><b>Bacto™</b> Proteose Peptone No. 2<br><b>Bacto™</b> Proteose Peptone No. 3<br><b>BiTek</b> Proteose Peptone No. 3<br><b>Bacto™</b> Proteose Peptone No. 4<br><b>Bacto™</b> Tryptose</td>\n</tr>\n<tr><th colspan=\"2\">CASEIN PEPTONES</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Bacto™</b> Casamino Acids<br><b>Bacto™</b> Casitone<br><b>Acidicase™</b> Peptone<br><b>Biosate™</b> Peptone</td>\n<td><b>Trypticase™</b> Peptone<br><b>Bacto™</b> TC Lactalbumin Hydrolysate<br><b>Bacto™</b> Tryptone<br><b>BiTek</b> Tryptone</td>\n</tr>\n<tr><th colspan=\"2\">SOY PEPTONES</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Phytone™</b> Peptone<br><b>Phytone™</b> UF (Select)</td>\n<td>Select Soytone<br><b>Bacto™</b> Soytone</td>\n</tr>\n<tr><th colspan=\"2\">YEAST EXTRACTS</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Bacto™</b> TC Yeastolate<br>TC Yeastolate, UF<br><b>Bacto™</b> Yeast Extract<br><b>Bacto™</b> Yeast Extract, Technical</td>\n<td>Yeast Extract<br>Yeast Extract, UF<br>Yeast Extract, LD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr><th colspan=\"2\">ALTERNATIVE PROTEIN SOURCE (APS)/NON-ANIMAL ORIGIN PRODUCTS</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Bacto™</b> Malt Extract<br><b>Phytone™</b> Peptone<br><b>Phytone™</b> UF (Select)<br>Select Soytone<br><b>Bacto™</b> TC Yeastolate<br>TC Yeastolate, UF<br><b>Bacto™</b> Yeast Extract</td>\n<td><b>Bacto™</b> Yeast Extract, Technical<br>Yeast Extract<br>Yeast Extract, UF<br>Yeast Extract, LD<br><b>Select APS™</b> LB Broth<br><b>Select APS™</b> Super Broth</td>\n</tr>\n</table>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCEL 300-50–TLC plates–MACHEREY-NAGEL (https://www.mn-net.com/us/TLC-glass-plates-cellulose-CEL-300-20x20-cm-808053)\nciteturn9search4 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 3 months ago;   * Technical data Cellulose MN 300 are native fibrous cellulose layers for TLC. ... Cellulose MN 300 are native fibrous cellulose layers for TLC.\n\n# TLC glass plates, cellulose, CEL 300, 20x20 cm\n\nImage: Macherey-Nagel\n\nSkip image gallery\n\nImage: TLC glass plates, cellulose, CEL 300, 20x20 cm\n\nImage: TLC glass plates, cellulose, CEL 300, 20x20 cm\n\nUS$438.00*\n\nPackage unit 20 Piece(s)\n\n*taxes and shipping not included\n\nItem number: 808053\n\nPackage unit 20 Piece(s)\n\n[Input]\n\n[Input] [Input] [Input] [Input] [Input] [Input] [Input] [Input] [Input]\n\nAdd to shopping cart\n\nDo you have any questions?\n\nPlease contact us.\n\n  * Technical data Cellulose MN 300 are native fibrous cellulose layers for TLC. Fiber length (95 %) 2–20 μm, average degree of polymerization… More\n\nClose menu\n\nCellulose MN 300 are native fibrous cellulose layers for TLC. Fiber length (95 %) 2–20 μm, average degree of polymerization 400–500. Different layer thickness available on glass plates (0.1, 0.25 and 0.5 mm). Available as glass plates, POLYGRAM polyester sheets and ALUGRAM aluminum sheets.\n\nBase material  | Glass plates coated with cellulose\nBinder  | Yes\nBrand  | CEL 300\nGross weight (incl. packaging)  | 3036 g / 6.69 lbs\nHazardous material  | No\nLayer hardness  | Standard, soft\nLayer thickness  | 0.5 mm\nMethod  | Thin layer chromatography (TLC), preparative (PLC)\nMode  | Normal phase (NP)\nPackaging dimensions  | 237 x 235 x 80 mm / 9.33 x 9.25 x 3.15 Inch\nParticle shape  | Irregular\nParticle size  | 2–20 µm\nParticle type  | Fully porous particles (FPP)\npH stability  | 2.0–8.0\nPhase  | CEL 300\nPlate size  | 20x20 cm\nPore volume  | Not available or not applicable\nRecommended application(s)  | Amino acids, Carbohydrates, Carboxylic acids, Polar substances\nScope of delivery  | 20x TLC glass plates (20x20 cm)\nStorage temperature  | 15–25 °C / 59–77 °F\nSupport material / backing  | Glass\nSurface chemistry  | Native fibrous cellulose\nTemperature stability  | High\nUV indicator  | No\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n60　鹿児島大学工学部研究報告　第34号（1992） (https://ir.kagoshima-u.ac.jp/record/4584/files/AN00040363_v34_p57-63.pdf)\nciteturn9search16 [wordlim: 200] Published: 15.4 years ago; Crawled: 15.4 years ago; Legend: ■ Tryptone, ○ Soytone, ▲ Casamino Acids, △ Peptone, □ ProteosePeptone.\n\n<table id=\"e3\">\n| 窒素源 | 原料 | 消化法 |\n|---|---|---|\n| Tryptone | ミルクカゼイン | 酵素（パンクレアチン） |\n| Soytone | 大豆タンパク | 酵素（パパイン） |\n| Casamino Acids | ミルクカゼイン | 塩酸による加水分解 |\n| Proteose Peptnoe | 獣肉 | 酵素（パパイン） |\n| Peptone | 混合ペプトン | カゼインペプトンと獣肉ペプトンの混合物 |\n</table>\n\nids, Peptone, Proteose Peptone）に置き換え，計5種類について比較した。これら5種類の窒素源はすべてタンパク質の加水分解（消化）物であり，それらの原料及び消化法を表4に示す。増殖，酵素活性ともに窒素源としてSoytoneを用いた時に最大値を示した。Soytoneは大豆タンパクの消化物であり，大豆の成分が酵素生産に有効である可能性が示唆される。\n\n2.3　WSG培地中の脱脂大豆の効果  \nWSG培地に使用される脱脂大豆の効果を実験的に検討するため，脱脂大豆を大豆消化物であるSoytoneあるいは脱脂大豆微粉末に置き換える実験を行った。--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nProbumin® Bovine Serum Albumin Universal Grade - (https://b2b.sigmaaldrich.com/NO/en/substance/probuminbovineserumalbuminuniversalgrade123459048468)\nciteturn9search5 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 5 months ago; Probumin^{®} Bovine Serum Albumin Universal Grade, pack of 100 g, ≥98%, USA Origin, Tested for IgG , ELISA: suitable, enzyme immunoassay: suitable, Serology: suitable\n\nImage: Probumin&#174; Bovine Serum Albumin Universal Grade pack of 5&#160;kg\n\n# Probumin^{®} Bovine Serum Albumin Universal Grade\n\nImage: Probumin&#174; Bovine Serum Albumin Universal Grade pack of 5&#160;kg\n\nCAS Number:\n\n9048-46-8\n\n\n### 810033\n\nProbumin^{®} Bovine Serum Albumin Universal Grade, pack of 100 g, ≥98%, USA Origin, Tested for IgG , ELISA: suitable, enzyme immunoassay: suitable, Serology: suitable\n\nExpand\n\n[Button: View Pricing]\n\n[Input]\n\n### 810037\n\nProbu